      "context_en": "Questions 208-211 refer to the following information: Ms. Chern is a 60 year old lady with insomnia for 8 years. Since last week she has been able to sleep for only about 2-3 hours each night. The Western medicine diagnosis is neurasthenia. Various hypnotics had been used to induce sleep, but no cure was achieved even when increasing the dosage. The patient asks for acupuncture treatment. The patient is emaciated. She lacks spirit and vitality and has malar flush, insomnia, palpitation, dizziness and tinnitus, and also feels a sensation of soreness and weakness in the lower back and buttocks, and a heat sensation in the medial, posterior aspect of the legs and soles. Her tongue is red with thin coating. The pulse is thready, rapid, and weak at the Chi (cubit) position of the left wrist.",
      "context_hant": "第208-211題根據下列資訊：陳女士（Chern），60歲，失眠已8年，近一週每晚僅能入睡約2-3小時。西醫診斷為神經衰弱，曾服用多種安眠藥，甚至加大劑量仍無法改善，因而尋求針灸治療。病人形體消瘦，精神不振，兩顴潮紅，並有失眠、心悸、頭暈、耳鳴、腰臀部痠軟、雙下肢內側後方及足心發熱等症狀。舌紅苔薄，左手尺脈細數而弱。"
